    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voodoo Fishin is an online co-op horror game featuring fishing, proximity voice, and scary monsters. You and up to 3 friends can venture into the swamp to find the best fishing spots holding the rarest fish. BEWARE: Die along the way, and you will lose your catch!<br><br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/cc5b52be6e913bbe420b71ea83ae60b1.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span><br>The demo represents an early look at the core fishing experience, puppet creator, and spooky vibes. The full game will include more monsters, a metagame, and deeper progression. <i><strong>Watch out! \u2014 there be bugs creepin' in them waters!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/884d4a23d3c5a5f98df715a148816c18.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your puppet angler and hit the dock!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/PageBanner_SellYourCAtch.png?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Make it back to the Fish Monger alive and sell your fish by the pound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ad12781dea149e389aa6c5f78fe411f6.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Baits, Reels, and Rods to hook the biggest, rarest fish!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voodoo Fishin is an online co-op horror game featuring fishing, proximity voice, and scary monsters. You and up to 3 friends can venture into the swamp to find the best fishing spots holding the rarest fish. BEWARE: Die along the way, and you will lose your catch!<br><br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/cc5b52be6e913bbe420b71ea83ae60b1.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span><br>The demo represents an early look at the core fishing experience, puppet creator, and spooky vibes. The full game will include more monsters, a metagame, and deeper progression. <i><strong>Watch out! \u2014 there be bugs creepin' in them waters!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/884d4a23d3c5a5f98df715a148816c18.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/24546b559562c114e9012fb68c1681a5.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your puppet angler and hit the dock!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/PageBanner_SellYourCAtch.png?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ea9e1a4bc21eb99f897034c40576292b.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Make it back to the Fish Monger alive and sell your fish by the pound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/ad12781dea149e389aa6c5f78fe411f6.webp?t=1750874855\" width=605 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.poster.avif?t=1750874855\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.webm?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071240/extras/072acd4c252bc09abc74ee28798b709a.mp4?t=1750874855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Baits, Reels, and Rods to hook the biggest, rarest fish!</p>",
